\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the proposed pipeline. A fine-tuned nnU-Net~\cite  {isensee2021nnunet} segments each MRI scan and extracts structured 2,825-dimensional embeddings. TaViT processes the patient-level embedding sequence augmented with per-scan treatment tokens and a molecular marker CLS token, jointly modeling tumor subregion volumes at every observed timepoint. As a complementary component, a FiLM-conditioned DDPM~\cite  {ho2020ddpm} interpolates between consecutive segmentation pairs to generate per-patient tumor evolution videos.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
